---
/**
 * Footer: the one disclaimer of every page (D11, S8 L-G). Its single paragraph
 * keeps the three trust facts in two sentences: information, not advice; the
 * order comes from a reviewable calculation and no entity pays to appear (S11);
 * every figure names its public source and date. Informational wording only.
 *
 * The band is separated from the page by one hairline (`border-t`), not by a
 * surface or a shadow. The links take the `link` recipe at the label role, so
 * they read as ink carried by the underline; cobalt stays with the best option.
 */
const year = new Date().getFullYear();

/** `claves-api` is a page of its own, so the footer link marks it while it is open. */
const onApiKeys = Astro.url.pathname.replace(/\/+$/, '') === '/claves-api';
---

<footer class="mt-section border-t border-border">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-page flex-col gap-block px-gutter py-section">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-block">
      <a href="/" class="wordmark text-text no-underline"> rindetuplata </a>
      <nav aria-label="Enlaces del pie">
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
          <li>
            <a class="type-label link" href="/metodologia/"> Cómo se calcula </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="type-label link" href="/claves-api/" aria-current={onApiKeys ? 'page' : undefined}>
              Claves API
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="type-label link"
              href="https://github.com/Mateocas1/rindetuplata"
              rel="noopener"
            >
              Código y capturas diarias
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <p class="type-body max-w-prose text-muted">
      Es información, no asesoramiento financiero. El orden sale de una cuenta que podés revisar,
      ninguna entidad nos paga por aparecer, y cada dato indica su fuente pública y su fecha.
    </p>

    <p class="type-label">© {year} rindetuplata</p>
  </div>
</footer>
